      <data key="d8">WLTP-Brake Cycle Events</data>
      <data key="d24">WLTP-Brake Cycle Events shall reflect the WLTP-Brake Cycle Procedure in accordance with Appendix 1 of Annex 4 to UN Regulation No 179.</data>
