      <data key="d69">The granting type-approval authority shall assign an emission type-approval number in accordance with Annex IV to Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2020/683 (7) and the sub-character table set out in Table 4 of Annex I to Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1706 (8).</data>
      <data key="d70">direct</data>
    </edge>
