      <data key="d68">Articles 27, 33 and 34 of Regulation (EU) 2018/858</data>
      <data key="d69">When applying Articles 27, 33 and 34 of Regulation (EU) 2018/858 of the European Parliament and of the Council (9) concerning amendments, revisions and extensions of type-approvals with regard to brake systems, manufacturers and type-approval authorities shall also comply with paragraphs 9.1 and 9.4 of UN Regulation No 179.</data>
